WEBVTT

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:32.500
(Find your peace)

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:03.000
竹林深处
(deep in the bamboo forest)

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:07.260
微风吹过
(breeze blows by)

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:10.800
清澈的水
(clear water)

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:15.020
慢慢流着
(flowing slowly)

00:01:15.460 --> 00:01:19.260
闭上眼睛
(close your eyes)

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:22.960
感受自然
(feel nature)

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:27.100
忘记烦恼
(forget worries)

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:31.040
心静如水
(heart is calm as water)

00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:35.160
阳光洒下
(sunlight spills)

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:43.540
美好时光
(beautiful times happy days)

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:50.920
自由自在
(free and easy let it flow)

00:01:51.620 --> 00:01:54.780
无忧无虑
(watch it grow)

00:01:55.540 --> 00:01:58.920
随风起舞
(dancing with the wind)

00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:03.360
在森林里
(in the forest through the trees)

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:37.460
绿色叶子
(green leaves)

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:39.000
蓝色的天

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:40.040
美丽画卷

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:42.040
在我眼前

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:45.520
鸟儿唱歌
(birds are singing)

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:46.500
花儿开放

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:49.180
这就是我
(this is life)

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:50.600
心之所向

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:54.500
阳光洒下
(sunlight spills)

00:02:55.540 --> 00:03:02.880
美好时光
(beautiful times happy days)

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:10.220
自由自在
(free and easy let it flow)

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:14.040
无忧无虑
(watch it grow)

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:58.640
一切都好
(everything is fine Peace of mind)

00:03:59.140 --> 00:04:01.760
慢慢来
(take it slow)

00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:17.640
安静
(quiet Rest now)
